    <string name="help_title">API (VBA-style JavaScript)</string>
    <string name="help_text">Scripts are JavaScript. Top-level code runs, then Main() if defined.\n\nCells(r, c).Value  — read/write a cell (1-based)\nRange("A1").Value, Range("A1:C3").Value = [[…]]\n.Offset(r, c)  .Address  .ClearContents()  .forEach(fn)\nSheet.Clear()  Sheet.LastRow("A")\nWorksheetFunction.Sum / Average / Max / Min / Count / CountA\n\nMsgBox(text, vbYesNo, title) → vbYes / vbNo …\nInputBox(text, title, default) → string ("" on cancel)\nDebug.Print a, b, …\n\nUserForm.Clear() / Show()\nUserForm.AddLabel(text)\nUserForm.AddTextBox(name, value) → .Value\nUserForm.AddButton(caption, function(){ … })\n\nLen Left Right Mid InStr Replace Split Join UCase LCase Trim\nCStr CInt CLng CDbl Val IsNumeric IsEmpty Int Fix Abs Sqr Rnd Round\nFormat(x, "#,##0.00") Format(Now(), "yyyy/mm/dd hh:nn:ss")\nColumnLetter(3) ColumnNumber("C")\n\nSandbox: no network, no file access. ■ kills the script.</string>
